       "estudio": "Mentre svuotava la casa della nonna, Elisa trovò una lettera mai spedita. Era indirizzata a una donna che nessuno in famiglia conosceva.",
       "alumno": "While she was emptying her grandmother's house, Elisa found a letter that had never been sent. It was addressed to a woman that nobody in the family knew.",
