       ],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "Poi la vita era cambiata: si era sposata, aveva avuto figli e non era più tornata. Elisa non capiva perché la lettera fosse rimasta nel cassetto.",
       "alumno": "Then life had changed: she had got married, had children and had not come back again. Elisa did not understand why the letter had stayed in the drawer.",
