       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "Sul retro c'era un indirizzo ancora leggibile. Dopo aver chiesto il permesso a sua madre, decise di cercare la destinataria durante le vacanze estive.",
       "alumno": "On the back there was an address that was still legible. After asking her mother's permission, she decided to look for the recipient during the summer holidays.",
